/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 160 0 R
/E (In the modern era, selecting a suitable career path has become increasingly complex due to the wide range of opportunities and rapidly evolving industry requirements. Many students and professionals face confusion in identifying the right career choices, required skills, and preparation strategies. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [16]
>>
endobj
293 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 160 0 R
/E (Traditional career guidance methods often lack personalization and fail to provide accurate, data-driven insights. To address these challenges, CareerPilot AI is developed as an intelligent career guidance system that leverages Artificial Intelligence to assist users in making informed career decisions.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [17]
>>
endobj
294 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 160 0 R
/E (CareerPilot AI is a comprehensive platform that integrates multiple functionalities, including career recommendation, resume analysis, interview preparation, and job suggestion. The system collects user data such as interests, skills, academic background, and resumes, and applies AI techniques like Natural Language Processing \(NLP\) and data analysis to evaluate the information. Based on this evaluation, the system identifies suitable career paths, highlights skill gaps, and provides actionable suggestions to improve employability.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [18]
>>
endobj
