/T (Traditional career counseling methods are often limited, time-consuming, and not personalized, which leads to confusion and wrong career choices. With the rapid advancement of technology, Artificial Intelligence \(AI\) has emerged as a powerful tool that can transform the way career guidance is provided. AI-based systems can analyze large amounts of data, understand user preferences, and generate accurate recommendations. This creates an opportunity to develop intelligent systems that offer personalized and data-driven career advice.)
/E (Traditional career counseling methods are often limited, time-consuming, and not personalized, which leads to confusion and wrong career choices. With the rapid advancement of technology, Artificial Intelligence \(AI\) has emerged as a powerful tool that can transform the way career guidance is provided. AI-based systems can analyze large amounts of data, understand user preferences, and generate accurate recommendations. This creates an opportunity to develop intelligent systems that offer personalized and data-driven career advice.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [18]
>>
