/E (2. Non-Functional Requirements : Non-functional requirements define how the system should perform. The system should be user-friendly and easy to navigate. It should provide fast and accurate results. The system must ensure data security and privacy. It should be reliable and available at all times The system should be scalable to handle multiple users. It must be compatible with different devices and browsers)
