809 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 187 0 R
/T (1. Top-Down Strategy:  Testing begins from the main modules such as the user interface and gradually moves to sub-modules like resume builder, career guidance, and interview preparation. 2. Bottom-Up Strategy:  Individual components like database connection, API functions, and authentication are tested first before integrating them into the main system. 3. Incremental Testing Strategy:  Modules are developed and tested step-by-step. Each new feature is tested after integration to ensure smooth performance. 4. System Testing Strategy:  After integrating all modules, the complete system is tested as a whole to verify overall functionality and performance.)
/E (1. Top-Down Strategy:  Testing begins from the main modules such as the user interface and gradually moves to sub-modules like resume builder, career guidance, and interview preparation. 2. Bottom-Up Strategy:  Individual components like database connection, API functions, and authentication are tested first before integrating them into the main system. 3. Incremental Testing Strategy:  Modules are developed and tested step-by-step. Each new feature is tested after integration to ensure smooth performance. 4. System Testing Strategy:  After integrating all modules, the complete system is tested as a whole to verify overall functionality and performance.)
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [18]
>>
endobj
