/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 187 0 R
/T (1. Black Box Testing:  The system is tested without knowing internal code structure. Inputs and outputs are checked for correctness, such as login validation and career suggestions. 2. White Box Testing:  Internal code structure is tested to verify logic, loops, database queries, and API functions in Node.js backend.)
/E (1. Black Box Testing:  The system is tested without knowing internal code structure. Inputs and outputs are checked for correctness, such as login validation and career suggestions. 2. White Box Testing:  Internal code structure is tested to verify logic, loops, database queries, and API functions in Node.js backend.)
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [20]
>>
endobj
