/T (CareerPilot AI provides useful career guidance, resume building, and interview preparation features, but it also has some limitations. The system is highly dependent on the accuracy and completeness of the data stored in the database. If the data is outdated or insufficient, the career suggestions and job recommendations may not be fully accurate.)
/E (CareerPilot AI provides useful career guidance, resume building, and interview preparation features, but it also has some limitations. The system is highly dependent on the accuracy and completeness of the data stored in the database. If the data is outdated or insufficient, the career suggestions and job recommendations may not be fully accurate.)
/Pg 40 0 R
/K [17]
>>
endobj
830 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 188 0 R
/T (Another limitation is that the system currently works on rule-based logic and predefined datasets rather than advanced real-time AI models. This reduces the personalization level of career recommendations compared to modern AI-driven platforms. The system also requires an active internet connection and a properly running backend server to function, which may cause issues if the server is down or slow.)
/E (Another limitation is that the system currently works on rule-based logic and predefined datasets rather than advanced real-time AI models. This reduces the personalization level of career recommendations compared to modern AI-driven platforms. The system also requires an active internet connection and a properly running backend server to function, which may cause issues if the server is down or slow.)
/Pg 40 0 R
/K [18]
>>
endobj
