/Title (CareerPilot AI provides useful career guidance, resume building, and interview preparation features, but it also has some limitations. The system is highly dependent on the accuracy and completeness of the data stored in the database. If the data is outdated or insufficient, the career suggestions and job recommendations may not be fully accurate.)
