/Title (CareerPilot AI is designed as an intelligent career guidance platform that helps users make informed career decisions. The system collects user information such as skills, interests, educational background, and resume data, and uses AI techniques to analyze this information. Based on the analysis, it suggests suitable career paths, identifies skill gaps, and recommends necessary improvements.)
