/Title (Another limitation is that the system currently works on rule-based logic and predefined datasets rather than advanced real-time AI models. This reduces the personalization level of career recommendations compared to modern AI-driven platforms. The system also requires an active internet connection and a properly running backend server to function, which may cause issues if the server is down or slow.)
/Dest [40 0 R /Fit]
