/Title (1. Functional Requirements : Functional requirements describe the main operations and features of the system. The system should allow users to register and login securely. It should collect user details such as skills, interests, and education. The system must analyze user data and suggest suitable career paths. It should identify skill gaps and recommend improvements. The system should provide a resume builder feature. It must include interview preparation with practice questions. The system should recommend jobs based on user profile)
